### Rust
# Cargo build output
target/

# Cargo.lock is deliberately NOT ignored. SOMUL ships binaries, and the
# ARCHITECTURE.md §15 release matrix cannot reproduce a bundle from an
# unpinned dependency graph.

# Backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

### Tauri
# Generated permission and capability schemas
src-tauri/gen/

# Override config written by scripts/serve-test-update.sh. It carries a throwaway public key and
# a plain-http endpoint, and committing it would put both one merge away from a real build.
src-tauri/tauri.updater-test.conf.json

### Signing keys
# The updater's private key signs releases that every installed copy will accept without asking,
# so a stray copy inside this repository is one push from being world-readable and permanent —
# GitHub is scraped for secrets within seconds. The real key lives in ~/.tauri, outside the tree;
# this pattern is here for the day someone generates one in the wrong directory.
*.key
*.key.pub

### Internal planning documents
# Design, architecture, and build-plan notes. Kept locally, deliberately not
# published: code comments carry the reasoning a contributor needs (CONTRIBUTING.md).
ARCHITECTURE.md
DESIGN.md
GOAL.md
DECISIONS.md
PROGRESS.md
